WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.920
Keep loading and emergency routes clear and follow parking
allocations. Use routes that minimise reversing where possible.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:22.160
Where the plan requires a trained signaller, they stay clear of
the vehicle path and in the driver's view. The driver stops
immediately on losing sight of the signaller.

